  "question": {
    "text": "A small liquid drop of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is divided into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn></math> identical liquid drops. If the surface tension is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>, then the work done in the process will be :",
